{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "始草書。即云佛之所詮概見乎教內。及寫奏時廼改曰。佛之能詮遺乎教\n內。意謂。佛之善巧詮發此法之語。存乎教部之內。為學徒以始草者傳出遂與奏本有異然此二說其義皆\n\n可用。他本或云。所詮概見乎教內者。蓋兩出之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是中書重批者。蓋降劄子後數日。又奉聖旨。更與輔教總入藏批此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宰相押字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宰相押字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰浮飯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別本或云鹿布"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即調伏阿羅邏迦蘭二仙人處也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云彌勒佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊譜云。世尊十九出家。六年雪山修行。三十成道。住世說法四十九年。七十九歲滅度。今以歲數推較。\n若秖六年修行。其成道則二十五歲。若云三十。則須并六年在二仙處學法。方可合其元數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見涅槃第二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記內翻梵語義類通華言者如此。迦葉波之類多有。或國本前錄已傳。不敢輒以梵學較之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云一千"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他部或云命迦\n旃延"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云未田地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "付法藏傳也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其妄驗於禪經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其中下一說元古本脫落"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以達磨六十七年後方東來。算之當在宋孝建元年甲午也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傳燈錄諸家舊說並云。達磨來梁。在普通八年。今按史書。普通秖至七年。唯今王佑長曆甲子數或有\n八歲可疑。又皆稱。蕭昂以達磨事奏。及考昂傳。不見其為廣州刺史。唯昂姪蕭勵。當時嘗作此州刺史。\n恐昔傳錄者。誤以勵為昂耳。前錄國本者。既是非不嫌。今不敢輒削。且存其闕疑也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今所謂山谷山寺者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今所謂雙峯山者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此當日見一人著縗絰而混。言類\n孝子者。蓋順乎祖師隱語之意耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋高僧傳也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "避諱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作智常"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作龍雲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作圓明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無石字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡其世數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此土之初祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此土之二祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此土之四祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解玄或山與寺名未詳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此土之五祖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事具其本傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偈亦具其本傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婆舍斯多也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事見其本傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以芬多到中國在齊王之世。則當列支彊之前。為其始顯於晉太始中故次之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "般若尚在達磨多羅未繼世作祖故\n未稱之。寶林傳所稱跋陀說其祖事與此並同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十七祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十\n八祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡當時為書之名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁簡文。當齊有國。方一戴餘即\n崩。然其死阨在賊臣暴亂之際。乃暇求法事耶。豈先此因使北聘已得是書手。又不見寶唱作續法記年月尚\n疑之。但取其文字。自北而傳南。其來有因。且從舊錄而筆之耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本字避御名下倣之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正字避國諱他倣之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本字避御名下倣之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "避字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本字避御名下倣之"}
